#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Gate Cutting to Reduce Circuit Width"
msgstr "Gate Cutting untuk Mengurangkan Lebar Circuit"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"qiskit-addons/cutting/01_gate_cutting_to_reduce_circuit_width.ipynb\" />\n"
msgstr "<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"qiskit-addons/cutting/01_gate_cutting_to_reduce_circuit_width.ipynb\" />\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In this notebook, we will work through the steps of a [Qiskit pattern](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/guides/intro-to-patterns) while using **circuit cutting** to reduce the number of qubits in a circuit.  We will cut gates to enable us to reconstruct the expectation value of a four-qubit circuit using only two-qubit experiments.\n"
msgstr "Dalam notebook ini, kita akan ikut langkah-langkah sebuah [corak Qiskit](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/guides/intro-to-patterns) sambil menggunakan **circuit cutting** untuk mengurangkan bilangan qubit dalam sebuah Circuit. Kita akan memotong gate-gate supaya kita boleh membina semula nilai jangkaan sebuah Circuit empat-qubit menggunakan eksperimen dua-qubit sahaja.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "These are the steps that we will take:\n"
msgstr "Ini adalah langkah-langkah yang akan kita ambil:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Step 1: Map problem to quantum circuits and operators**:\n"
msgstr "**Langkah 1: Petakan masalah kepada circuit-circuit kuantum dan operator-operator**:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Map the hamiltonian onto a quantum circuit.\n"
msgstr "Petakan hamiltonian ke atas sebuah circuit kuantum.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Step 2: Optimize for target hardware** [_Uses the cutting addon_]:\n"
msgstr "**Langkah 2: Optimumkan untuk perkakasan sasaran** [_Menggunakan addon cutting_]:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "<font color='#0F62FE'>Cut the circuit and observable.</font>\n"
msgstr "<font color='#0F62FE'>Potong Circuit dan observable.</font>\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Transpile the subexperiments for hardware.\n"
msgstr "Transpile subeksperimen-subeksperimen untuk perkakasan.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Step 3: Execute on target hardware**:\n"
msgstr "**Langkah 3: Laksanakan pada perkakasan sasaran**:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run the subexperiments obtained in Step 2 using a `Sampler` primitive.\n"
msgstr "Jalankan subeksperimen-subeksperimen yang diperoleh dalam Langkah 2 menggunakan primitif `Sampler`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Step 4: Post-process results** [_Uses the cutting addon_]:\n"
msgstr "**Langkah 4: Proses keputusan** [_Menggunakan addon cutting_]:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "<font color='#0F62FE'>Combine the results of Step 3 to reconstruct the expectation value of the observable in question.</font>\n"
msgstr "<font color='#0F62FE'>Gabungkan keputusan-keputusan Langkah 3 untuk membina semula nilai jangkaan observable yang berkenaan.</font>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 1: Map {#step-1-map}"
msgstr "Langkah 1: Peta {#step-1-map}"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create a circuit to cut {#create-a-circuit-to-cut}"
msgstr "Buat Circuit untuk dipotong {#create-a-circuit-to-cut}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Quantum circuit diagram](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/01-gate-cutting-to-reduce-circuit-width/output_1.png)\n"
msgstr "![Rajah circuit kuantum](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/01-gate-cutting-to-reduce-circuit-width/output_1.png)\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Specify an observable {#specify-an-observable}"
msgstr "Tentukan sebuah observable {#specify-an-observable}"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 2: Optimize {#step-2-optimize}"
msgstr "Langkah 2: Optimumkan {#step-2-optimize}"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Separate the circuit and observable according to a specified qubit partitioning {#separate-the-circuit-and-observable-according-to-a-specified-qubit-partitioning}"
msgstr "Asingkan Circuit dan observable mengikut pembahagian qubit yang ditentukan {#separate-the-circuit-and-observable-according-to-a-specified-qubit-partitioning}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Each label in `partition_labels` corresponds to the `circuit` qubit in the same index. Qubits sharing a common partition label will be grouped together, and non-local gates spanning more than one partition will be cut.\n"
msgstr "Setiap label dalam `partition_labels` sepadan dengan qubit `circuit` pada indeks yang sama. Qubit-qubit yang berkongsi label partition yang sama akan dikumpulkan bersama, dan gate-gate bukan tempatan yang merentangi lebih daripada satu partition akan dipotong.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Note:** The ``observables`` kwarg to `partition_problem` is of type `PauliList`. Observable term coefficients and phases are ignored during decomposition of the problem and execution of the subexperiments. They may be re-applied during reconstruction of the expectation value.\n"
msgstr "**Nota:** Argumen ``observables`` kepada `partition_problem` adalah jenis `PauliList`. Pekali dan fasa terma observable diabaikan semasa penguraian masalah dan pelaksanaan subeksperimen. Ia boleh digunakan semula semasa pembinaan semula nilai jangkaan.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Visualize the decomposed problem {#visualize-the-decomposed-problem}"
msgstr "Visualkan masalah yang telah diuraikan {#visualize-the-decomposed-problem}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Quantum circuit diagram](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/01-gate-cutting-to-reduce-circuit-width/output_2.png)\n"
msgstr "![Rajah circuit kuantum](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/01-gate-cutting-to-reduce-circuit-width/output_2.png)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Quantum circuit diagram](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/01-gate-cutting-to-reduce-circuit-width/output_3.png)\n"
msgstr "![Rajah circuit kuantum](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/01-gate-cutting-to-reduce-circuit-width/output_3.png)\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Calculate the sampling overhead for the chosen cuts {#calculate-the-sampling-overhead-for-the-chosen-cuts}"
msgstr "Kira overhead pensampelan untuk potongan yang dipilih {#calculate-the-sampling-overhead-for-the-chosen-cuts}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Here we cut two CNOT gates, resulting in a sampling overhead of $9^2$.\n"
msgstr "Di sini kita memotong dua gate CNOT, menghasilkan overhead pensampelan sebanyak $9^2$.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For more on the sampling overhead incurred by circuit cutting, refer to the [explanatory material](../explanation/index.rst).\n"
msgstr "Untuk maklumat lanjut tentang overhead pensampelan yang ditanggung oleh circuit cutting, rujuk [bahan penerangan](../explanation/index.rst).\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Generate the subexperiments to run on the backend {#generate-the-subexperiments-to-run-on-the-backend}"
msgstr "Jana subeksperimen untuk dijalankan pada Backend {#generate-the-subexperiments-to-run-on-the-backend}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "`generate_cutting_experiments` accepts `circuits`/`observables` args as dictionaries mapping qubit partition labels to the respective `subcircuit`/`subobservables`.\n"
msgstr "`generate_cutting_experiments` menerima argumen `circuits`/`observables` sebagai kamus yang memetakan label partition qubit kepada `subcircuit`/`subobservables` masing-masing.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To simulate the expectation value of the full-sized circuit, many subexperiments are generated from the decomposed gates' joint quasiprobability distribution and then executed on one or more backends. The number of samples taken from the distribution is controlled by `num_samples`, and one combined coefficient is given for each unique sample. For more information on how the coefficients are calculated, refer to the [explanatory material](../explanation/index.rst).\n"
msgstr "Untuk mensimulasikan nilai jangkaan Circuit bersaiz penuh, banyak subeksperimen dijana daripada taburan kuasiprobabiliti bersama gate-gate yang diuraikan dan kemudiannya dilaksanakan pada satu atau lebih Backend. Bilangan sampel yang diambil daripada taburan dikawal oleh `num_samples`, dan satu pekali gabungan diberikan bagi setiap sampel unik. Untuk maklumat lanjut tentang cara pekali dikira, rujuk [bahan penerangan](../explanation/index.rst).\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Choose a backend {#choose-a-backend}"
msgstr "Pilih sebuah Backend {#choose-a-backend}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Here we are using a fake backend, which will result in Qiskit Runtime running in local mode (i.e., on a local simulator).\n"
msgstr "Di sini kita menggunakan Backend palsu, yang akan menyebabkan Qiskit Runtime berjalan dalam mod tempatan (iaitu, pada simulator tempatan).\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare the subexperiments for the backend {#prepare-the-subexperiments-for-the-backend}"
msgstr "Sediakan subeksperimen untuk Backend {#prepare-the-subexperiments-for-the-backend}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We must transpile the circuits with our backend as the target before submitting them to Qiskit Runtime.\n"
msgstr "Kita mesti men-transpile Circuit-circuit dengan Backend kita sebagai sasaran sebelum menghantarnya ke Qiskit Runtime.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 3: Execute {#step-3-execute}"
msgstr "Langkah 3: Laksanakan {#step-3-execute}"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run the subexperiments using the Qiskit Runtime Sampler primitive {#run-the-subexperiments-using-the-qiskit-runtime-sampler-primitive}"
msgstr "Jalankan subeksperimen menggunakan primitif Sampler Qiskit Runtime {#run-the-subexperiments-using-the-qiskit-runtime-sampler-primitive}"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 4: Post-process {#step-4-post-process}"
msgstr "Langkah 4: Proses Keputusan {#step-4-post-process}"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Reconstruct the expectation value {#reconstruct-the-expectation-value}"
msgstr "Bina semula nilai jangkaan {#reconstruct-the-expectation-value}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Reconstruct expectation values for each observable term and combine them to reconstruct the expectation value for the original observable.\n"
msgstr "Bina semula nilai-nilai jangkaan bagi setiap terma observable dan gabungkannya untuk membina semula nilai jangkaan bagi observable asal.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Compare the reconstructed expectation value with the exact expectation value from the original circuit and observable {#compare-the-reconstructed-expectation-value-with-the-exact-expectation-value-from-the-original-circuit-and-observable}"
msgstr "Bandingkan nilai jangkaan yang dibina semula dengan nilai jangkaan tepat daripada Circuit dan observable asal {#compare-the-reconstructed-expectation-value-with-the-exact-expectation-value-from-the-original-circuit-and-observable}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<TutorialFeedback />\n"
msgstr "<TutorialFeedback />\n"
